pan class="status gray">待分析</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="status warn">预警</span></td><td>南昌基地 · 某客户项目</td><td>销售成本高于预算，项目毛利率下降</td><td class="red">-¥176万</td><td><span class="status gray">待分析</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class="status ok">亮点</span></td><td>宜昌基地 · 储能产品线</td><td>收入和毛利同步超预算，客户结构改善</td><td class="green">+¥265万</td><td><span class="status ok">已确认</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="top-split"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title">有利影响 TOP 3 <small>按绝对金额排序</small></div><div v-for="(row,index) in topFavorable" :key="row[0]" class="top-item"><span class="rank hot">{{ index + 1 }}</span><b>{{ row[0] }}</b><span class="top-value green">{{ row[1] }}</span><span class="top-rate green">{{ row[2] }}</span></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title">不利影响 TOP 3 <small>需下钻确认</small></div><div v-for="(row,index) in topAdverse" :key="row[0]" class="top-item"><span class="rank">{{ index + 1 }}</span><b>{{ row[0] }}</b><span class="top-value red">{{ row[1] }}</span><span class="top-rate red">{{ row[2] }}</span></div></div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:15px"><div class="panel-title">统一经营指标 <small>绝对GAP与百分比GAP · {{ scenarioLabel }}</small></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="pnl-table"><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>当前值</th><th>基准值</th><th>绝对GAP</th><th>GAP%</th><th>AI简析</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in metrics" :key="m.code"><td>{{ m.name }}</td><td>{{ format(m.code, scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).current) }}</td><td>{{ format(m.code, scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).base) }}</td><td :class="scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).gap >= 0 ? 'green' : 'red'">{{ format(m.code, scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).gap) }}</td><td>{{ scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).rate === null ? '—' : `${(scenarioGap(m.actual, m.budget).rate * 100).toFixed(1)}%` }}</td><td>{{ m.aiSummary || '—' }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
